; Real-terminal scenarios: the built TUI inside tmux, panes captured and
; compared by cram (dune promote re-records). Each .t file is a group of
; scenarios from harness.sh; dune runs the groups in parallel. Skipped when
; tmux is absent.

(cram
 (deps harness.sh %{bin:prigh-tui})
 (enabled_if %{bin-available:tmux}))
